{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13212020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13212020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1321202001:1":{"text":"Oh, there's a snowman!","source_cn":"啊！那边有个雪人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x921D3ED061E446ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321202002:1":{"text":"I think I hear it talking...","source_cn":"我好像听到它在说话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7C60D0A373E83DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321202003:1":{"text":"And it looks familiar!","source_cn":"看着有些眼熟啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B37614B51677709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321202004:1":{"text":"Oh, I remember! That's the snowman from the ceremony!","source_cn":"啊！我想起来了，这不是祭典上面的那个雪人吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE17BC716812B984B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321202005:1":{"text":"That mage activated so many snowmen... What was his name?","source_cn":"那个魔法师激活了好多雪人……叫什么来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AF63CF78EF07A2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321202006:1":{"text":"... Witstaff! Played around with his magic and made the snowmen go crazy and melt!","source_cn":"——维茨瓦夫！乱用魔法让雪人们都狂化了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x689FF20A85D116DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321202007:1":{"text":"Luckily it was out in the middle of nowhere, where those rampaging snowmen couldn't hurt anyone at least.","source_cn":"幸好这里荒郊野岭，当时那些狂暴的雪人，太容易伤人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84EB9E5AC9483C25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321202008:1":{"text":"Magister, we have to dispel that awful magic from the snowman!","source_cn":"主人，我们得赶紧消除它身上错误的魔法！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2A3F55332635E52E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, we have to dispel that awful magic from the snowman!","female":"Magister, we have to dispel that awful magic from the snowman!","variant_male_record_index":"145134","variant_female_record_index":"145135","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321202009:1":{"text":"Huh? There's a human... And two talking rats! I've been spotted!","source_cn":"什么？有人类……还有两只会说话的老鼠！咱被发现了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F46EC339817D4B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321202010:1":{"text":"Run, run! I haven't even seen the wildflowers yet. I can't get held up here!","source_cn":"快跑快跑！咱还没见过花呢！可不能在这里被逮到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x582B8F1C93DDD3E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1321201001:":{"text":"How come there aren't any wildflowers here? ...","source_cn":"这里怎么也没有野花啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A3A07129BD7293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1321201002:":{"text":"It's not easy being a snowman!","source_cn":"雪生艰难啊~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BEA87D3D1567628","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1321201003:":{"text":"I have to see them—before I melt away!","source_cn":"在化掉前，一定要看到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E908C56036EAC99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:13021211:0":{"text":"You encounter a snowman escaping from the festival in the wild but accidentally scare it away.","source_cn":"你们在野外遇到一只从祭典上逃跑的雪人，却不小心把它吓跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD794A65A9DFD4FE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":